&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left; text-indent: -36px"&gt;２．新株予約権及び自己新株予約権に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left; text-indent: -36px"&gt;　　　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left; text-indent: -36px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingNewShareSubscriptionRightsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">
